{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content of the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo</strong> features the first level of the game, offering approximately 30 minutes of gameplay. Within this level, players can obtain up to four Melodies, along with the Journals tied specifically to the first stage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let the Rhythm guide you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong> you'll take the role of the <strong>Pulsedrifter</strong>, a young rebel that struggles to survive in <strong>New Nexus: A cyberpunk metropolis</strong> where all forms of art are banned, artists are persecuted, and progress has suffocated the soul of humanity. Music is your ally and the <strong>beat</strong> is your weapon. Fight to bring back voice, color, and <strong>rhythm</strong> to a city cast into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.poster.avif?t=1757584821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.webm?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/bd5ecd4853d0cc071b34e849903038af.mp4?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat your enemies with Melodies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong> blends <strong>rhythm</strong> with the intensity of a <strong>Hack &amp; Slash</strong>. Each battle unfolds in arenas where time is dictated by the music, and the closer you time your actions to the <strong>beat</strong>, the stronger you become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of the combat system are <strong>Melodies: customizable combos</strong> where you assign the inputs, creating your own unique and <strong>rhythmic</strong> fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.poster.avif?t=1757584821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.webm?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/8ec4a19c9a19cc493012de01017084b4.mp4?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Cyberpunk city of New Nexus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>three levels</strong>, each with its own environment and <strong>increasing</strong> <strong>BPM</strong>. Explore the Underbelly of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, overcoming traps, hacking gates, dashing over gaps always following the <strong>Beat</strong>. Follow the <strong>rhythm</strong> to uncover the <strong>secrets</strong>, dive into the city, and meet its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.poster.avif?t=1757584821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.webm?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.mp4?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948800?t=1757584821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948800?t=1757584821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/dac1b6459378936bc1b2107d323d80a90f260cee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757584821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/dac1b6459378936bc1b2107d323d80a90f260cee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757584821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Beat of Rebellion contains strong language, blood, implicit references to drugs."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content of the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>demo</strong> features the first level of the game, offering approximately 30 minutes of gameplay. Within this level, players can obtain up to four Melodies, along with the Journals tied specifically to the first stage</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let the Rhythm guide you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Beat of Rebellion</strong> you'll take the role of the <strong>Pulsedrifter</strong>, a young rebel that struggles to survive in <strong>New Nexus: A cyberpunk metropolis</strong> where all forms of art are banned, artists are persecuted, and progress has suffocated the soul of humanity. Music is your ally and the <strong>beat</strong> is your weapon. Fight to bring back voice, color, and <strong>rhythm</strong> to a city cast into silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas