"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Cyberpunk city of New Nexus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>three levels</strong>, each with its own environment and <strong>increasing</strong> <strong>BPM</strong>. Explore the Underbelly of <strong>New Nexus</strong>, overcoming traps, hacking gates, dashing over gaps always following the <strong>Beat</strong>. Follow the <strong>rhythm</strong> to uncover the <strong>secrets</strong>, dive into the city, and meet its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.poster.avif?t=1757584821\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.webm?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/extras/f951e4c93d2481712d906e4ef54e7e85.mp4?t=1757584821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["CyberRaccoons"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3908260","name":"Beat of Rebellion"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948800/28b5fee91ef5c50662746b67f627d7ccdb059409/header.jpg?t=1757584821","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181610,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181610/movie480.mp4?t=1757584820","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181610/movie_max.mp4?t=1757584820"},"name":"Beat_Of_Rebellion_Rhythm_Cyberpunk_Melodies_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25718